{"id":"cryptobotany","name":{"en":"Cryptobotany","ja":"奇想天外"},"desc":{"en":"A strange plant that grows only in the wastelands and is said to have a several hundred year lifespan. It will die if planted in fertile soil.","ja":"荒地にのみ生える生命力の強い草。非常に寿 命が長く、数百年単位で成長することもざら にある。その代わり、栄養に富んだ土地に移 植すると、あっという間に枯れ果ててしまう。"},"level":8,"locations":[{"id":"silver-lands","name":{"en":"Silver Lands","ja":"白銀の大地"}},{"id":"scorched-wasteland","name":{"en":"Scorched Wasteland","ja":"灼熱の荒野"},"parent":"arland-wastelands"}],"traits":{"id":"regen-essence","name":{"en":"Regen Essence","ja":"再生エキス"}},"categories":[{"id":"mystery","name":{"en":"(Mystery)","ja":"（神秘の力）"},"icon":"totori-category-mystery"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":14}